		ct mark 0x00000001 ct direction original limit rate over 640 kbytes/second burst 6843 bytes update @journal_v6 { ip6 saddr . ip6 daddr . meta l4proto limit rate 1/second } limit name "journal" log prefix "MDOU|externe|entree|DEBIT|" group 101
