		ct mark 0x00000001 ct direction reply limit rate over 640 kbytes/second burst 6843 bytes counter name "rejets" drop
		ct mark 0x00000002 meta length > 1400 update @journal_v4 { ip saddr . ip daddr . meta l4proto limit rate 1/second } limit name "journal" log prefix "MDOU|externe|entree|TAILLE|" group 101
		ct mark 0x00000002 meta length > 1400 update @journal_v6 { ip6 saddr . ip6 daddr . meta l4proto limit rate 1/second } limit name "journal" log prefix "MDOU|externe|entree|TAILLE|" group 101
